quo;s 4 grids, January to February came in under 90% of normal in 34 of those years, the same count as February to March. The 2026 numbers so far stay low on the middle, with Feb-Mar at 54% and Mar-Apr at 56%. All 4 grids had their driest year in 2007, and grid 19077 got 62% of normal that year.</p>"}
